  <!-- Right end effector: PSYONIC Ability Hand (right), replacing the OpenArm gripper.
       Source: dexterous-hand-urdf/dexhand_description/ability_hand/ability_hand_right_glb.urdf
       (see meshes/ee/ability_hand/LICENSE.txt). Values are the vendor's; names get the
       openarm_right_ prefix, vendor "base" is openarm_right_hand, and vendor base_link/base_joint
       is folded into right_openarm_hand_joint. That joint puts the wrist adapter on the link7
       flange (z = 0.0955); its yaw makes the palm face the body midline and the thumb point
       forward at the zero pose. Meshes are the vendor OBJ as STL in metres (scale 1 1 1).
